  m_text: '1) Use WASD to move and arrow keys to rotate view


    2) Left click
    to break blocks (only gray blocks can be broken)


    3) Use the spacebar to
    switch gravity. Once you touch the new surface you can move around and drop back
    down in a different location


    4) Watch out for the blue spikey ores, running
    into them causes you to restart


    5) Make it to the black exit door to complete
    the level

'
